      "text": "--> Jupiter :\n\n    ° Largest planet in the solar system\n    ° Gas giant\n    ° Its diameter is eleven times \n      that of Earth\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    ° Fifth planet from the sun\n    ° Most massive planet\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    ° Named after jupiter ( god ) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    ° It has also multiple moons ( satellites )\n\n\n\n\n    ° ...",
