        "MipTt3Bo7lLFCOfpejp-E",
        "BGCqsayWqwpLb-mdPx0ia"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793709698747,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Elyra :\n\n--> Adds extensions for AI\n    ° Focuses to make the \n      AI development easier \n      and more productive\n\n--> Flexible :\n    ° More tabs ( e.g. opened notebooks )\n\n--> Extensible :\n    ° Bring new features\n\n\n--> Reusable Code Snippets :\n    ° makes it easy to reuse code\n      for various programming languages\n\n\n--> Versioning using Git :\n    ° Simplify tracking changes\n    ° Allows SHARING \n\n\n--> Language Server Protocol :\n    ° bring linting,\n    ° refactoring ( eg. variable renaming ) ,\n    ° auto - completion\n    ° code navigation, e.g. \n      jump to a function code\n    ° hover suggestion\n    ° function signature\n    ° syntax highlighting\n    ° on the flight error checking\n    ° More IDE feelings : these tools can also be found in IDEs\n\n\n--> Debugging :\n    ° Xeus package\n\n\n\n--> Automated Table of Contents for Navigation",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Elyra :\n\n--> Adds extensions for AI\n    ° Focuses to make the \n      AI development easier \n      and more productive\n\n--> Flexible :\n    ° More tabs ( e.g. opened notebooks )\n\n--> Extensible :\n    ° Bring new features\n\n\n--> Reusable Code Snippets :\n    ° makes it easy to reuse code\n      for various programming languages\n\n\n--> Versioning using Git :\n    ° Simplify tracking changes\n    ° Allows SHARING \n\n\n--> Language Server Protocol :\n    ° bring linting,\n    ° refactoring ( eg. variable renaming ) ,\n    ° auto - completion\n    ° code navigation, e.g. \n      jump to a function code\n    ° hover suggestion\n    ° function signature\n    ° syntax highlighting\n    ° on the flight error checking\n    ° More IDE feelings : these tools can also be found in IDEs\n\n\n--> Debugging :\n    ° Xeus package\n\n\n\n--> Automated Table of Contents for Navigation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793612154994,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
