      "text": "--> The Goals of Elyra :\n\n--> Run Scripts or Jupyter Notebooks in REMOTE Environments to\n    avoid Resource Constraints\n\n--> Run Mutliple Notebooks / Scripts In \n    ° Sequence\n    or\n    ° Parallel\n\n    ==> Pipeline\n\n\n--> Scheduled Run\n\n\n--> Levreage Existing Workflow Orchestrators",
