      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "--> You create a Pipeline :\n\n    ° We push it to an Execution Runtime :\n\n        - Local Execution \n        or\n        - ( Remote ) Execution using KubeFlow\n        or\n        - ( Remote ) Execution using AirFlow\n        or\n        - ( Remote ) Execution using OpenShift",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> You create a Pipeline :\n\n    ° We push it to an Execution Runtime :\n\n        - Local Execution \n        or\n        - ( Remote ) Execution using KubeFlow\n        or\n        - ( Remote ) Execution using AirFlow\n        or\n        - ( Remote ) Execution using OpenShift",
