      "updated": 1793709879229,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "--> Data volumes : \n\n        ° is when you want to exchange the data between the nodes \n          and that large data will not go through the wire. \n\n        ° So we mount the volume in each one of the nodes \n          and so we will reduce the network traffic",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Data volumes : \n\n        ° is when you want to exchange the data between the nodes \n          and that large data will not go through the wire. \n\n        ° So we mount the volume in each one of the nodes \n          and so we will reduce the network traffic",
